<title>USA: PacifiCare, FHP clear FTC hurdle.</title>
<headline>PacifiCare, FHP clear FTC hurdle.</headline>
<dateline>CYPRESS, Calif. 1997-01-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>PacifiCare Health Systems Inc and FHP International Corp on Wednesday said the U.S. Federal Trade Commission has closed its investigation of the companies' planned merger.</p>
<p>&quot;The satisfactory resolution to this review should put to rest any anti-competitive concerns,&quot; the companies said in a statement.</p>
<p>Closing the deal is conditional on receiving regulatory approval and is expected to take place by early February 1997.</p>
</text>
